    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Stepped Content, a powerful Gutenberg plugin for WordPress, revolutionizes content presentation. Seamlessly organize your information into interactive steps or tabs, enhancing user experience and engagement effortlessly.</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://bblockswp.com/demo/stepped-content/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demos</a></strong></p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Interactive Steps</strong>: Effortlessly organize content into intuitive steps.</li>\n<li><strong>Remaining Duration</strong>: The time left to finish reading the content.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to use</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First, install the Stepped Content plugin</li>\n<li>Add the Stepped Content block from the block category called &#8220;Widgets&#8221; in the Gutenberg editor.</li>\n<li>You can change block settings from the right-side settings sidebar.</li>\n<li>\n<p>Enjoy!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>For installation help click on Installation Tab</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Feedback</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Did you like this plugin? Dislike it? Do you have a feature request? <a href=\"mailto:&#115;u&#x70;&#112;&#x6f;&#114;&#x74;&#064;&#x62;&#112;l&#x75;&#103;&#x69;&#110;&#x73;&#046;&#x63;&#x6f;&#109;\" title=\"Send feedback\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Please share your feedback with us</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Check out the Parent Plugin of this plugin-</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://bblockswp.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>B Blocks</strong></a> – A blocks collection and page building tool for Gutenberg.</p>\n<h3>Check out our other WordPress Plugins-</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/html5-video-player/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>Html5 Video Player</strong></a> – Display videos as single and playlist in multiple skins.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/pdf-poster/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>PDF Poster</strong></a> – Display/Embed PDF files with different styles.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/html5-audio-player/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>Html5 Audio Player</strong></a> – Listen audios with awesome visuals.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/streamcast-radio-player/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>StreamCast</strong></a> – Customizable radio player with different skins.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/3d-viewer/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>3D Viewer</strong></a> – Embed 3D models and 3D products with interaction.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/advanced-post-block/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>Advanced Post Block</strong></a> – Show posts and custom posts in different layouts.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<h4>From Gutenberg Editor:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to the WordPress Block/Gutenberg Editor</li>\n<li>Search For <strong>Stepped Content</strong></li>\n<li>Click on the <strong>Stepped Content</strong> to add the block</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Download &amp; Upload:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the <strong>Stepped Content</strong> plugin (<em>.zip file</em>)</li>\n<li>In your admin area, go to the Plugins menu and click on <strong>Add New</strong></li>\n<li>Click on <strong>Upload Plugin</strong> and choose the <strong><code>step.zip</code></strong> file and click on <strong>Install Now</strong></li>\n<li>Activate the plugin and Enjoy!</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Manually:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Download and upload the <strong>Stepped Content</strong> plugin to the <strong><code>/wp-content/plugins/</code></strong> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the Plugins menu in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='is%20stepped%20content%20free%3F'>\nIs Stepped Content free?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, Stepped Content is a free Gutenberg block plugin.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='does%20it%20work%20with%20any%20wordpress%20theme%3F'>\nDoes it work with any WordPress theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it will work with any standard WordPress theme.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20change%20block%20settings%3F'>\nCan I change block settings?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can change block settings from the Gutenberg block editor&#8217;s right sidebar.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='how%20many%20times%20can%20i%20reuse%20a%20block%3F'>\nHow many times can I reuse a block?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can use unlimited times as you want.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='where%20can%20i%20get%20support%3F'>\nWhere can I get support?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can post your questions on the <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/stepped-content/\" rel=\"ugc\">support forum here</a></p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.4 &#8211; 27 Jan 25</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update SDK.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.3 &#8211; 04 Jul 24</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix the title visible issue.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2 &#8211; 29 Jun 24</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Upgrade for multiple features.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1 &#8211; 7 Jan 24</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Performance Improvement.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial Release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Seamlessly organize your information into interactive steps",
    "description": "<p>Stepped Content, a powerful Gutenberg plugin for WordPress, revolutionizes content presentation. Seamlessly organize your information into interactive steps or tabs, enhancing user experience and engagement effortlessly.</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://bblockswp.com/demo/stepped-content/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demos</a></strong></p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Interactive Steps</strong>: Effortlessly organize content into intuitive steps.</li>\n<li><strong>Remaining Duration</strong>: The time left to finish reading the content.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to use</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First, install the Stepped Content plugin</li>\n<li>Add the Stepped Content block from the block category called &#8220;Widgets&#8221; in the Gutenberg editor.</li>\n<li>You can change block settings from the right-side settings sidebar.</li>\n<li>\n<p>Enjoy!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>For installation help click on Installation Tab</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Feedback</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Did you like this plugin? Dislike it? Do you have a feature request? <a href=\"mailto:&#115;u&#x70;&#112;&#x6f;&#114;&#x74;&#064;&#x62;&#112;l&#x75;&#103;&#x69;&#110;&#x73;&#046;&#x63;&#x6f;&#109;\" title=\"Send feedback\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Please share your feedback with us</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Check out the Parent Plugin of this plugin-</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://bblockswp.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>B Blocks</strong></a> – A blocks collection and page building tool for Gutenberg.</p>\n<h3>Check out our other WordPress Plugins-</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/html5-video-player/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>Html5 Video Player</strong></a> – Display videos as single and playlist in multiple skins.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/pdf-poster/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>PDF Poster</strong></a> – Display/Embed PDF files with different styles.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/html5-audio-player/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>Html5 Audio Player</strong></a> – Listen audios with awesome visuals.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/streamcast-radio-player/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>StreamCast</strong></a> – Customizable radio player with different skins.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/3d-viewer/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>3D Viewer</strong></a> – Embed 3D models and 3D products with interaction.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/advanced-post-block/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>Advanced Post Block</strong></a> – Show posts and custom posts in different layouts.</p>\n",
